🔥MacroBenchMark

MacroBenchMark is android jetpack library which is used to measure performance of entire app as userPerspective
like startupTime , scrolling smoothness , navigation and ui performance


macroBenchMark measure
1- startupTimeMatrix
2- frameTimeMatrix


🔹Code Syntax :

@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)
@LargeTest
class LoginBenchmark {

    @get:Rule
    val benchmarkRule = MacroBenchmarkRule()

@Test
loginFlow() = benchmarkRule.measureRepeated(
package = com.example.demo,
 matrix = listOf(FrameMatrix())
startupMode = StartupMode.COLD
iteration = 5,
){

startActivityAndWait()
device.findObject(By.res("username"))
        .text = "admin"

    device.findObject(By.res("password"))
        .text = "123456"

    device.findObject(By.text("Login"))
        .click()
device.waitForIdeal()
}

}



